# Shell scripts must keep LF line endings: Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true by default)
# would otherwise check them out with CRLF and Git Bash fails on "\r" (ADR 0087).
*.sh text eol=lf
# Launchers (ADR 0117): the macOS .command runs in bash (LF), the Windows .bat in cmd (CRLF).
*.command text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
# Committed Windows launcher (ADR 0150), built by tools/launcher-windows/build.sh.
*.exe binary
